    {
      "Original": "Show the ID for elements. \r\nPlease turn this on before you submit a bug report. \r\nIt helps me to identify problems faster.",
      "Container": "NecroLens.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_ExtrasTab_ShowDebugInformation_Details",
      "Translated": "显示元素的 ID。\r\n提交故障报告前请打开此项，\r\n以便更快定位问题。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Automatically open in DeepDungeon",
      "Container": "NecroLens.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_GeneralTab_AutomaticallyOpen",
      "Translated": "进入深层迷宫时自动打开",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Opens the Main window when you enter a DeepDungeon.\r\nIt shows some handy information and quick access to Settings.",
      "Container": "NecroLens.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_GeneralTab_AutomaticallyOpen_Details",
      "Translated": "进入深层迷宫时打开主窗口。\r\n可在此查看相关信息并快速打开设置。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Enable ESP Overlay",
      "Container": "NecroLens.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_GeneralTab_EnableOverlay",
      "Translated": "启用透视叠加层",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Draws the ESP overlay showing the positions of Chests, Mobs and all aggro ranges.\r\nYou can configure everything you want to see under ESP Settings.\r\nImportant: The ESP can only show objects in the games render distance.\r\nThis is fixed and CAN NOT be changed!",
      "Container": "NecroLens.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_GeneralTab_EnableOverlay_Details",
      "Translated": "叠加显示宝箱、怪物位置及敌人的感知范围。\r\n可在叠加显示设置中选择要显示的内容。\r\n注意：只能显示游戏渲染距离以内的对象。\r\n这个距离固定，无法修改！",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Enable OpenChests",
      "Container": "NecroLens.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_GeneralTab_OpenChests",
      "Translated": "启用开箱功能",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "EXPERIMENTAL FEATURE\r\nAutomatically opens chest for you once you're in interaction range.\r\nBy default it will NOT open chests which can be Mimics this set!\r\n\r\nThis feature can cause your character being stuck next to a chest!\r\nIf this happens disable this feature.",
      "Container": "NecroLens.Data.Strings.resources",
      "Key": "ConfigWindow_GeneralTab_OpenChests_Details",
      "Translated": "实验性功能\r\n进入交互范围后自动开箱。\r\n默认会跳过本组楼层中可能出现宝箱怪的宝箱！\r\n\r\n此功能可能导致角色卡在宝箱旁。\r\n如果发生，请关闭此功能。",
      "Source": "library"
